            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Tamarra"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a super easy crowd pleaser. A variant to use to change things up when you want to is to add package of brown gravy mix instead of the BBQ sauce. Also red or black currant jelly works instead of grape jelly. It gives a slightly less sweet and more tangy taste.",
            "datePublished": "2024-08-07T22:26:32.686Z"
          },
          {
